{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15823","headline":"秋晚送丹徒许明府赴上国因寄江南故人 · 崔峒","name":"秋晚送丹徒许明府赴上国因寄江南故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋暮之彭泽，篱花远近逢。\n君书前日至，别後此时重。\n寒夜江边月，晴天海上峰。\n还知南地客，招引住新丰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}